Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||01-14-2000||05:42 PM||||Yep, I just saw it. Although I really don't mind him setting up a similar messageboard as this one, the reason why is beyond me.<P>I had set up this forum because I felt there was a great need for a place where people could discuss anything Fiero related - without being moderated to death. I'm not sure what need he is trying to satisfy...<P>Oh well, like I said - I don't mind. It's (mostly) a free world.<BR>||||reg||5
