Z||000004||William Federle||01-14-2000||10:16 PM||||I also think that V8 Archie is a good guy. I hope some day to be able to afford one of his V8 kits. I check and (if I have something to offer) contribute to his bulletin board to see if anything interesting is on it. Good ideas can come from anywhere. I just hope it doesn't deteriorate like the list did. I hope this doesn't offend anyone because this forum of Cliff's has greatly contributed to my education so far concerning the upkeep of my Fiero. <p>[This message has been edited by William Federle (edited 01-14-2000).]||||reg||1
